{
  "id": "observation-types",
  "doc": "What kind of observation a span is. Ordered first-match rules: the rank *is* the knowledge, because the answer is a precedence rather than a set of independent facts.\n\nThe order says three things worth stating plainly. A transport attribute makes a span a plain span whatever else it carries, because with a framework SDK present that span duplicates the real generation. A conventional operation name outranks a dialect's own span-kind attribute, since the convention is the more specific statement. And a span *name* that merely mentions a tool loses to any attribute, because a name is the weakest evidence there is.\n\nA rule holds when **every** one of its `all_of` conditions holds, and each condition is internally a disjunction. Three rules need that conjunction, and each is a case where one signal alone means something different: an operation name beside a model whose name says it is an embedding, an operation name beside the system that gives it another meaning, and a dialect's model attribute beside the operation id that says which call it was.",
  "observation_types": [
    {
      "id": "observation.transport",
      "rank": 10,
      "doc": "An HTTP, RPC or database call is never a GenAI observation: with a framework SDK present the transport span duplicates the real generation, and showing both counts one call twice. Whether such traces are visible at all is the trace list's business, not this one's.",
      "all_of": [
        {
          "attr_exists": [
            "http.method",
            "http.request.method",
            "rpc.system",
            "db.system"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "result": "span"
    },
    {
      "id": "observation.chat_of_an_embedding_model",
      "rank": 20,
      "doc": "Some telemetry reports an embedding call as a chat completion. The model's own name settles it, and the test is case-insensitive because a model id is a provider's string, not a keyword.",
      "all_of": [
        {
          "attr_equals": [
            {
              "key": "gen_ai.operation.name",
              "value": "chat"
            },
            {
              "key": "gen_ai.operation.name",
              "value": "text_completion"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text_contains": {
            "sources": [
              "attr:gen_ai.request.model",
              "attr:gen_ai.response.model"
            ],
            "needles": [
              "embed"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "result": "embedding"
    },
    {
      "id": "observation.chat",
      "rank": 30,
      "all_of": [
        {
          "attr_equals": [
            {
              "key": "gen_ai.operation.name",
              "value": "chat"
            },
            {
              "key": "gen_ai.operation.name",
              "value": "text_completion"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "result": "generation"
    },
    {
      "id": "observation.embeddings",
      "rank": 40,
